{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>He made darkness</b> — With the roar of the waves of the sea its waters churn and the vapor rising increases; therefore darkness is born there, and this is the darkness of waters, thickness of vapor when it is thick, and it is the cloud. And the meaning is the descent of decrees, and no person sees them."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:27:31.886834933Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}